3304 REM --- DISPLAY PAGE ---
3305 PF%=(PX%-1)*PG%+1
3306 PL%=PF%+PG%-1
3307 IF PL%>TC% THEN PL%=TC%
3308 IX%=PF%
3309 IF IX%>PL% THEN GOTO 3313
3310 GOSUB 7100: REM DECODE NAME
3311 LN$="  "+STR$(IX%)+". "+NA$+", "+VN$: GOSUB 1018
