3313 REM --- PAD REMAINING LINES ---
3314 PD%=PG%-(PL%-PF%+1)
3315 IF PD%<=0 THEN GOTO 3318
3316 LN$="": GOSUB 1018: PD%=PD%-1: GOTO 3315
3318 LN$="": GOSUB 1018
3319 TP%=INT((TC%+PG%-1)/PG%)
